      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The feeling of meaninglessness is the most honest thing you can feel right now, and you don't have to pretend otherwise. If the world has proven itself incapable of seeing your worth, then stop trying to prove it to them. You are not a ghost; you are a person who has been deeply hurt, and that pain is valid. Sometimes, the only way to stop waiting for something to happen is to decide what you want to happen to yourself.",
