    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"decide what i want to happen to myself.\" what does that even mean? like i can just choose to stop feeling this? everything feels so heavy and permanent. it's like i'm stuck in a loop of just being alone and sad for no reason. is there even a version of this where it doesn't just keep getting worse? it feels like the only way to actually find some peace is to just... not be here anymore.",
